<?php if (!luxureat_cms_detail('zh-recipe-truffle-tagliolini', 'zh', 'recipe')): ?><main class="lux-article-page"><nav class="lux-breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑导航"><a href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('zh', '')); ?>">首页</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('zh/recipe', '')); ?>">食谱艺术</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">白松露或黑松露细面</span></nav><article class="lux-recipe-reader lux-recipe-seo-page"><section class="lux-recipe-hero"><figure><img width="1000" height="560" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/journal/recipe-truffle-tagliolini.webp'); ?>" alt="白松露或黑松露细面"></figure><div class="lux-recipe-intro"><span>意式主食</span><h1 id="lux-reader-title">白松露或黑松露细面</h1><p>精致而令人回味无穷的头盘，是庆祝特殊场合的完美之选。新鲜的鸡蛋细面拌入黄油和帕玛森奶酪，再撒上大量的白松露或黑松露碎，带来令人难忘的香气体验。</p><dl class="lux-recipe-facts"><div><dt>时间</dt><dd>25分钟</dd></div><div><dt>难度</dt><dd>中等</dd></div><div><dt>份量</dt><dd>2人份</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class="lux-recipe-body"><aside class="lux-recipe-ingredients"><h2>食材</h2><ul><li>250克意大利饺子（奶酪馅或蘑菇馅）</li><li>30克黄油</li><li>2汤匙鲜奶油</li><li>4-5片新鲜黑松露</li><li>1汤匙磨碎的帕玛森干酪</li><li>新鲜切碎的欧芹适量</li><li>盐和胡椒粉适量</li></ul></aside><div class="lux-recipe-method"><h2>准备</h2><ol><li>煮馄饨：将一锅加盐的水烧开，然后按照包装上的说明煮馄饨（如果是新鲜的，则煮3-4分钟）。</li><li>准备酱汁。在平底锅中，用小火融化黄油，加入奶油和一汤匙煮馄饨的水。搅拌至酱汁浓稠顺滑。</li><li>将馄饨轻轻沥干水分，倒入盛有酱汁的锅中。加入帕玛森奶酪，翻炒1-2分钟。</li><li>装饰盘子，最后放上几片新鲜黑松露和少许切碎的欧芹。</li></ol></div></section><section class="lux-recipe-nutrition"><header><h2>每份的估计营养成分</h2></header><dl><div><dt>能量</dt><dd>1750千焦（约420千卡）</dd></div><div><dt>饱和脂肪</dt><dd>9克（45%）</dd></div><div><dt>碳水化合物（糖类）</dt><dd>3克</dd></div><div><dt>蛋白质</dt><dd>14克</dd></div></dl><figure class="lux-recipe-video"><video controls playsinline preload="none" poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/journal/recipe-truffle-tagliolini.webp'); ?>" aria-label="白松露或黑松露细面"><source src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/recipes/truffle-tagliolini.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><figcaption>从面粉到鲜面，手作的细致为松露意面铺垫风味。</figcaption></figure><div class="lux-recipe-extra-videos"><video style="flex-grow: 0.5625; aspect-ratio: 0.5625" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" controls aria-label="白松露或黑松露细面 1"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/scene-13636685.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video style="flex-grow: 0.527859; aspect-ratio: 0.527859" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" controls aria-label="白松露或黑松露细面 2"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/scene-4253138.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video style="flex-grow: 1.777778; aspect-ratio: 1.777778" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" controls aria-label="白松露或黑松露细面 3"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/products/videos/scene-19905874.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video></div></section><section class="lux-recipe-details"><div><dt>参考产区</dt><dd>参考：皮埃蒙特风味</dd></div><div><dt>推荐用油</dt><dd>温和果香型特级初榨橄榄油</dd></div><div><dt>过敏原提示</dt><dd>含麸质、蛋、奶</dd></div><div><dt>可替换食材</dt><dd>新鲜意面可替换为干意面；黄油可用橄榄油减少乳制品</dd></div><div><dt>相关产品</dt><dd><a class="lux-recipe-product-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('zh/product', '?category=truffle#product-catalogue')); ?>">LuxurEat（露意膳）松露与意大利面产品</a></dd></div></section></article></main><?php endif; ?>
